From: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Subject: [PATCH] i860: add port for the Samsung MAGIC Station II

arch/i860, SCSI, LAN and other drivers, FP traps with IEEE results, modules not yet supported.

Against upstream commit 36aad21d50d1af3f6954bb0c988257a908202477 (Merge tag 'ksmbd-for-7.4-rc1-part2' of git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/linkinjeon/smb).
Branch i860 at cb8bb6074b7b. Tested in the MAME magicst2 model only, not on real hardware.

Signed-off-by: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
